  [1;34m"body"[m[1;37m:[m [32m"## Summary\n\nAdds the **second gate** in the ArchW1z spine for Agentic Termux integration testing.\n\n```\nrepo-gate (hygiene)  →  termux-smoke (runtime surface)  →  later language/provider gates\n```\n\n## What's new\n\n| Path | Purpose |\n|------|--------|\n| `scripts/ci/termux_smoke.py` | stdlib-only smoke: Python ≥3.9, gate layout, git/bash, tmp, optional deepcli/archwiz compile probes |\n| `.github/workflows/termux-smoke.yml` | Runs on PR + push to `master` / `master-staging` / `termux-smoke` |\n| `docs/TERMUX-SMOKE.md` | Full gate documentation |\n| `docs/ARCHW1Z-GATE.md` | Updated to describe the two-gate spine |\n\n## Design rules (same constitution as repo-gate)\n\n- **stdlib only** for the core path — no pip, cargo, node, or network required\n- Runs identically on-device and in CI\n- Optional probes (`--with-optional`) never execute network code; compile/help only\n- Agents can consume `--json` output and stop before provider work if `ok: false`\n\n## How to run on device\n\n```bash\npython3 scripts/ci/termux_smoke.py\npython3 scripts/ci/termux_smoke.py --with-optional\npython3 scripts/ci/termux_smoke.py --json\n```\n\n## Relation to ChatGPT Critical-Eval\n\nImplements the \"Termux smoke tests\" layer the Critical-Eval placed after the cheap repo-gate and before provider/Rust work.\n\n## Merge criteria\n\n- Both repo-gate and termux-smoke green\n- No new session/browser/credential debt\n- Docs accurate\n\n**LFG.**\n<!-- devin-review-badge-begin -->\n\n---\n\n<a href=\"https://app.devin.ai/review/timerloggedout-spec/termux-monorepo/pull/11\" target=\"_blank\">\n  <picture>\n    <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://static.devin.ai/assets/gh-open-in-devin-review-dark.svg?v=1\">\n    <img src=\"https://static.devin.ai/assets/gh-open-in-devin-review-light.svg?v=1\" alt=\"Open in Devin Review\">\n  </picture>\n</a>\n<!-- devin-review-badge-end -->"[m[1;37m,[m
